  "problem": "Suppose we want to measure the height of the Statue of Liberty. Which metric unit could we use?",
  "worked_solution": "A table showing the metric units of length is given below.\n\n| Name | Symbol |\n| --- | --- |\n| Kilometer | $\\text{km}$ |\n| Meter | $\\text{m}$ |\n| Centimeter | $\\text{cm}$ |\n| Millimeter | $\\text{mm}$ |\n\nTherefore, from the given options, the only unit of length is $\\text{m}.$",
